{"success": true, "message": "Test details sent successfully", "data": {"test": {"_id": "69de21f97e39d99b57bc5b8a", "analysisVideoCdn": "yt", "exam": ["605dfcb2f226ac25a8bd5fef"], "ctype": null, "position": 0, "order": 12, "enableCalculator": false, "isContinuousQuestion": false, "reattemptAvailable": false, "singleSectionMultipleSubjects": false, "timeRestricted": false, "title": "p Block Elements (Group 13 & 14) - Test 1", "description": "Previous Year Questions as Chapter Test", "syllabus": "This test contains questions from all topics of this chapter included in the JEE Main syllabus. It includes a mix of questions from PYQs of JEE Main 2019 - 2025.", "totalTime": 37, "totalQuestions": 25, "totalMarks": 100, "bonusQuestions": null, "bonusMarks": null, "startDate": "2026-04-15T03:30:00.000Z", "endDate": "2027-04-30T00:00:00.000Z", "type": "free", "class": "605df635a37b7025c438d685", "instruction": "608289ffb160b022e9442c83", "subjects": [{"subjectId": "607018ee404ae53194e73d91", "totalMarks": 100, "bonusMarks": 0, "totalQuestions": 25, "bonusQuestions": 0, "_id": "69de4f2f2ee0e063d924ba07"}], "sections": [{"sectionId": {"_id": "69de4f2f2ee0e063d924ba02", "title": "Chemistry Single Correct", "sectionType": "normal", "subject": "607018ee404ae53194e73d91", "questions": [{"_id": "69de4f2f2ee0e063d924b8e7", "type": "singleCorrect", "chapters": ["60d2d1d2185d7a32fa3205b3"], "topics": ["60e2fada66f9ce3f243b4772"], "concepts": ["6162fba46ed13040ec851558"], "question": {"text": "<p>Given below are two statements:</p><p>Statement I: Boron is extremely hard indicating its high lattice energy.</p><p>Statement II: Boron has highest melting and boiling point compared to its other group members.</p><p>In the light of the above statements, choose the most appropriate answer from the options given below</p>"}, "options": [{"id": "f60558", "text": "Both Statement I and Statement II are incorrect", "isCorrect": null, "_id": "69de4f2f2ee0e063d924b8e8"}, {"id": "d9246f", "text": "Sta