. } & \\text { Refrigerants } \\\\\n\\hline\n\\end{array}\\)\nChoose the correct answer from the options given below:"}, "options": [{"id": "6ed69f", "text": "A-I, B-II, C-III, D-IV", "isCorrect": null, "_id": "69de4f2f2ee0e063d924b8f2"}, {"id": "2b19b6", "text": "A-III, B-I, C-IV, D-II", "isCorrect": null, "_id": "69de4f2f2ee0e063d924b8f3"}, {"id": "fdfb8c", "text": "A-II, B-IV, C-I, D-III", "isCorrect": null, "_id": "69de4f2f2ee0e063d924b8f4"}, {"id": "fda606", "text": "A-III, B-II, C-IV, D-I", "isCorrect": null, "_id": "69de4f2f2ee0e063d924b8f5"}], "questionLabels": []}, {"_id": "69de4f2f2ee0e063d924b8f6", "type": "singleCorrect", "chapters": ["60d2d1d2185d7a32fa3205b3"], "topics": ["60e2fb2066f9ce3f243b4b7c"], "concepts": ["62a9ada3c9b014050cba06db"], "question": {"text": "<p>Match List-I with Match List-II</p><table border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"1\" cellspacing=\"1\" style=\"width: 500px;\">\t<tbody>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td>&nbsp;</td>\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong>List-I<br />\t\t\t(Metal)</strong></td>\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">&nbsp;</td>\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong>List-II<br />\t\t\t(Application)</strong></td>\t\t</tr>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td>(A)</td>\t\t\t<td><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>Cs</mi></math></td>\t\t\t<td>(I)</td>\t\t\t<td>High temperature thermometer</td>\t\t</tr>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td>(B)</td>\t\t\t<td><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>Ga</mi></math></td>\t\t\t<td>(II)</td>\t\t\t<td>Water repellent sprays</td>\t\t</tr>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td>(C)</td>\t\t\t<td><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi></math></td>\t\t\t<td>(III)</td>\t\t\t<td>Photoelectric cells</td>\t\t</tr>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td>(D)</td>\t\t\t<td><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>Si</mi></math></td>\t\t\t<td>(V)</td>\t\t\t<td>Bullet proof vest</td>\t\t</tr>\t</tbody></table><p>Choose the most appropriate answer from the options given below</p>"}, "opt