<mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mfenced><mi>II</mi></mfenced><mo>,</mo><mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">D</mi></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mfenced><mi>II</mi></mfenced></math>", "isCorrect": null, "_id": "69de4f2f2ee0e063d924b8fa"}], "questionLabels": []}, {"_id": "69de4f2f2ee0e063d924b8fb", "type": "singleCorrect", "chapters": ["60d2d1d2185d7a32fa3205b3"], "topics": ["60e567ac499d1e49588f95f2"], "concepts": ["65c2269282df720c6985c853"], "question": {"text": "The number of ions from the following that are expected to behave as oxidising agent is :\n\\(\\mathrm{Sn}^{4+}, \\mathrm{Sn}^{2+}, \\mathrm{Pb}^{2+}, \\mathrm{Tl}^{3+}, \\mathrm{Pb}^{4+}, \\mathrm{Tl}^{+}\\)"}, "options": [{"id": "6c1147", "text": "3", "isCorrect": null, "_id": "69de4f2f2ee0e063d924b8fc"}, {"id": "9293c7", "text": "2", "isCorrect": null, "_id": "69de4f2f2ee0e063d924b8fd"}, {"id": "b0e79d", "text": "1", "isCorrect": null, "_id": "69de4f2f2ee0e063d924b8fe"}, {"id": "2878bb", "text": "4", "isCorrect": null, "_id": "69de4f2f2ee0e063d924b8ff"}], "questionLabels": []}, {"_id": "69de4f2f2ee0e063d924b900", "type": "singleCorrect", "chapters": ["60d2d1d2185d7a32fa3205b3"], "topics": ["60e2fada66f9ce3f243b4772"], "concepts": ["6162fba46ed13040ec85155e"], "question": {"text": "In which one of the following molecules strongest back donation of an electron pair from halide to boron is expected?"}, "options": [{"id": "b47d8c", "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>BI</mi><mn>3</mn></msub></math>", "isCorrect": null, "_id": "69de4f2f2ee0e063d924b901"}, {"id": "d28fec", "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>BBr</mi><mn>3</mn></msub></math>", "isCorrect": null, "_id": "69de4f2f2ee0e063d924b902"}, {"id": "dfd670", "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>BCl</mi><mn>3</mn></msub></math>", "isCorrect": null, "_id": "69de4f2f2ee0e063d924b903"}, {"id": "e50622", "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w